  "releaseNotes": "Added adaptive Huffman Brotli encoding, Huffman/FSE Zstandard encoding, and match-based LZO1X encoding. Added a buffered managed GZIP decoder, zlib preset-dictionary decoding, and asynchronous streaming helpers that preserve asynchronous destination I/O through codec finalization. Hardened compressed-data validation and exact decoded-size checks. Brotli includes MIT-licensed normative dictionary and transform data.",
